        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 24:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mumwaka wamuchitanu nachiwana, mukakweji kekumi, mwifuku dakakweji dekumi, izu daYehova denjili nawa cheŋi kudami, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.24.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.24.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 24:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nindi, Eyi mwana kamuntu, sonekaku ijina defuku, dodifuku dalelu dinu. Mwanta wakuBabiloni wakundamini kwakwihi naYerusalema dodifuku dalelu dinu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.24.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.24.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 24:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tilaku mutaŋa wadikaŋa chishimu, wuyili neyi, Mwanta Yehova nindi, Shaku inuŋu hakesi, shaku, huŋunwinenumu meji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.24.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.24.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 24:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pompeshelenumu nyisunyi yayu, nyisunyi yayiwahi yejima, nimwendu nichikasa; yinzeshi mafwaha akusakula. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.24.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.24.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 24:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwataku chimuna chakusakula mwiyinda, lumbikaku nchawa mwishina dayu; yibwakatishi chachiwahi; eŋa, mafwaha adumu ahi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.24.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.24.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 24:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.24.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.24.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 24:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi Mwanta Yehova nindi, Yayo, o mukala wamashi! Yayo, o inuŋu yikweti ndala mukachi, yabula kufuma ndala yidumu! Fumishakumu mbiji hamusunyi hamusunyi. Hikunayimwekeni chinjikijilu chakusakula nachuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.24.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.24.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 24:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa mashi indi adi mukachi kindi. Yena wayisha dehi helola hatooka. Hanayi huŋununi heseki akayishikili lunkuŋuku; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.24.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.24.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 24:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ami nashi dehi mashi indi helola hatooka, kulonda akabuli kuyishikila, kulonda akaleteshi kulendumuka kwakutenda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.24.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.24.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 24:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi Mwanta Yehova nindi, Yayo, o mukala wamashi, ami nawa nakatohesha mulumba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.24.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.24.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 24:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Vulishaku nchawa, kundakeshaku kesi, telekaku mbiji chachiwahi, kondeshaku muzoŋu, kulonda mafwaha asukumi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.24.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.24.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 24:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkumininaku wakayishi hamakalayu chakadi chuma mukachi, yakatati, wuneŋu wayu wakasukumi, kulonda majilu ayu akasuŋu nukumu, kulonda ndala yayu yakamani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.24.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.24.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 24:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nadizeyeshi dehi kwindi namanyidimu; hela chochu, ndala yindi yasweja hiyamufumaŋaku, ndala yindi hiyamufumaŋa nakesuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.24.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.24.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 24:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Majilu eyi yowu kubajama; chinakwila dehi tookeshe-e hiwatookaŋaku, komana hiwamba katooka nawa cheŋi majilu eyuku, chiŋa nakumanishili dehi kulendumuka kwami. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.24.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.24.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 24:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ami Yehova inachihoshi dehi, chakamwekana, nakachikoŋa. Hinakafunta munyima, hela kwanakena, hela kubalumuka mumuchimaku. Mwomwaya njila jeyi, mwomwaya yuma yiwelaŋa, dimu mwakakusompeshelawu. Dimu mwanahoshiyi Mwanta Yehova.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.24.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.24.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 24:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.24.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.24.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 24:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Izu daYehova denjili nawa cheŋi kudami, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.24.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.24.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 24:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nindi, Eyi mwana kamuntu, tiya, hinukukufumisha weyi iwamona kuwaha, iŋanda dimu hohu. Bayi wakadishona hela kudilaku, hela madilu eyi bayi awulumukaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.24.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.24.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 24:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kumina dakudishishimona hohu, ilaŋa bayi chitiyakanaku. Bayi wumudila makumbu adilaŋawu mufuku, kumina dakujiŋajiŋa ihina deyi kunamutu, kumina dakuvwala masaŋatu eyi kunyendu, bayi wakabuta kunyivumbu yeyuku, bayi wakadya yakudya yawantuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.24.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.24.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 24:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hinukuyilejamu antu nabudidi; chikuneli melela iŋodami hakufwa. Chikunachi hinukwila mwanlejawu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.24.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.24.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 24:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.24.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.24.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 24:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Antu hiyakuŋila nawu, Imu muwudi nakwila, etu chikutulejadi? Hiwukutuleja mwoku? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.24.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.24.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 24:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hinukuyila nami, Izu daYehova denza kudami,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.24.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.24.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 24:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.24.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.24.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 24:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eyi mwana kamuntu, ifuku dinakayifumisha chuma chamwenawu Ŋovu, nichuma chawu chalubanji chazaŋajalilaŋawu, chamonawu kuwaha, chashawu nyichima yawu, nianyanawu amayala nawambanda, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.24.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.24.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 24:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "dena ifuku odu muntu wakapuluka hakenza kudeyi nakukuleja, kulonda wutiyi namatu eyuku? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.24.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.24.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 24:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dena ifuku odu kanwa keyi kakamujikukila owu muntu napuluki, wakahosha, hiwakekala nawa cheŋi kamamaku. Chochina wakekala chinjikijilu chakutalilahu wena. Akeluka nawu yami Yehova.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.24.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.24.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
